00:14:29,030 --> 00:14:30,360
<font size="64">We should have a chat with him.</font>

592
00:14:30,600 --> 00:14:32,770
<font size="64">- This is too much. - Call him over for a talk.</font>

593
00:14:31,210 --> 00:14:35,050
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Will they be able to work as a team and make a good deduction?)</font>

594
00:14:33,600 --> 00:14:35,270
<font size="64">- Where? - Where foreigners visit.</font>

595
00:14:35,310 --> 00:14:37,310
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They go with Se Chan's pick and head to HYBE.)</font>

596
00:14:35,570 --> 00:14:36,800
<font size="64">Let's check out HYBE first.</font>

597
00:14:36,800 --> 00:14:38,370
<font size="64">- You... - Okay. Leave me alone.</font>

598
00:14:37,310 --> 00:14:39,050
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Upset)</font>

599
00:14:38,610 --> 00:14:40,440
<font size="64">- Check out yesterday's broadcast. - Hey.</font>

600
00:14:40,440 --> 00:14:42,110
<font size="64">See how many times I promoted your song.</font>

601
00:14:40,620 --> 00:14:43,120
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Today's Yang In Ha)</font>

602
00:14:42,110 --> 00:14:44,610
<font size="64">- You pretended to be Kwon In Ha. - I worked hard for you.</font>

603
00:14:44,910 --> 00:14:46,580
<font size="64">Seok Jin, let's take him to a corner.</font>

604
00:14:46,580 --> 00:14:48,720
<font size="64">- Yes. You come here. - What for? Come on.</font>

605
00:14:48,690 --> 00:14:51,700
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A secret gathering without the Antenna leader)</font>

606
00:14:48,720 --> 00:14:50,350
<font size="64">- You need a lesson. - Guys.</font>

607
00:14:50,350 --> 00:14:51,720
<font size="64">- You really... - No, I...</font>

608
00:14:51,720 --> 00:14:53,290
<font size="64">- Jae Seok was awarded. - How dare you?</font>

609
00:14:52,260 --> 00:14:54,700
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Hitting)</font>

610
00:14:53,290 --> 00:14:54,590
<font size="64">- Drop it for Jae Seok. - Seriously.</font>

611
00:14:55,360 --> 00:14:56,560
<font size="64">Don't go too far.</font>

612
00:14:55,470 --> 00:14:58,700
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Lee So Ra and Choi Kang Rok discipline him with soft punches.)</font>

613
00:14:56,660 --> 00:14:57,860
<font size="64">Why did you join in?</font>

614
00:14:58,690 --> 00:15:00,330
<font size="64">The way you look at Jae Seok is different...</font>

615
00:14:58,700 --> 00:15:01,710
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Offended)</font>

616
00:15:00,330 --> 00:15:03,760
<font size="64">- from how you look at him. - The wrong path</font>

617
00:15:02,340 --> 00:15:06,180
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Will they be able to find the place in the hint?)</font>

618
00:15:03,760 --> 00:15:06,330
<font size="64">- Creates a new map - Creates a new map</font>

619
00:15:06,380 --> 00:15:08,610
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Candidate 1: HYBE)</font>

620
00:15:06,970 --> 00:15:09,670
<font size="64">- Okay. Let's go to HYBE. - HYBE is famous.</font>

621
00:15:08,610 --> 00:15:13,620
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They head to the HYBE building based on Se Chan's suggestion.)</font>

622
00:15:11,040 --> 00:15:12,610
<font size="64">Soon, we'll get out of the van...</font>

623
00:15:12,610 --> 00:15:13,940
<font size="64">- Yes. - and search for...</font>

624
00:15:13,620 --> 00:15:16,320
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The detailed rules of the location search get revealed.)</font>

625
00:15:13,940 --> 00:15:15,710
<font size="64">- the first fall location. - Okay.</font>

626
00:15:15,710 --> 00:15:18,310
<font size="64">You get two chances per location to confirm if you're right.</font>

627
00:15:18,310 --> 00:15:19,310
<font size="64">- Okay. - I see.</font>

628
00:15:18,790 --> 00:15:20,490
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Location 1)</font>

629
00:15:19,310 --> 00:15:21,420
<font size="64">We'll get out at wherever you think is the right place,</font>

630
00:15:20,490 --> 00:15:23,430
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Is this the right place?)</font>

631
00:15:21,420 --> 00:15:23,550
<font size="64">and you must say, "Confirm the location."</font>

632
00:15:23,430 --> 00:15:26,400
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(No.)</font>

633
00:15:23,720 --> 00:15:25,550
<font size="64">- We'll tell you if you're right. - You will.</font>

634
00:15:25,550 --> 00:15:27,090
<font size="64">- If we ask? - Yes.</font>

635
00:15:26,500 --> 00:15:28,030
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Location 1)</font>

636
00:15:27,090 --> 00:15:29,420
<font size="64">If you use both chances and still fail to find the spot,</font>

637
00:15:28,030 --> 00:15:29,170
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Is this the right place?)</font>

638
00:15:29,170 --> 00:15:30,570
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Unable to receive mission funds)</font>

639
00:15:29,420 --> 00:15:31,060
<font size="64">you don't get any money.</font>

640
00:15:30,570 --> 00:15:32,000
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They fail to receive mission funds if they fail twice.)</font>

641
00:15:31,560 --> 00:15:34,030
<font size="64">If we think we're at the wrong place,</font>

642
00:15:33,800 --> 00:15:37,210
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(More people will get penalized if they fail to make money.)</font>

643
00:15:34,030 --> 00:15:35,500
<font size="64">we can go somewhere else, right?</font>

644
00:15:35,500 --> 00:15:36,660
<font size="64">- That's right. - Yes.</font>

645
00:15:36,900 --> 00:15:39,100
<font size="64">It'll be a place many foreigners visit.</font>

646
00:15:39,100 --> 00:15:41,030
<font size="64">- Yes, but would it be Yongsan? - Right?</font>

647
00:15:41,030 --> 00:15:43,040
<font size="64">- I think it could be Jongno. - I think it's Myeongdong.</font>

648
00:15:43,040 --> 00:15:44,140
<font size="64">I think it's Jongno.</font>

649
00:15:44,770 --> 00:15:46,810
<font size="64">It's not the Myeongdong area.</font>

650
00:15:46,810 --> 00:15:47,810
<font size="64">It's not?</font>

651
00:15:47,810 --> 00:15:49,610
<font size="64">Jae Seok's old college was in Myeongdong.</font>

652
00:15:47,820 --> 00:15:49,690
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Old Seoul Institute of the Arts)</font>

653
00:15:49,610 --> 00:15:50,940
<font size="64">- Then he'd know. - He knows for sure.</font>

654
00:15:51,010 --> 00:15:52,980
<font size="64">Because if it were Myeongdong,</font>

655
00:15:52,980 --> 00:15:55,120
<font size="64">- it wouldn't be that far off. - Right. It would be closer.</font>

656
00:15:54,360 --> 00:15:58,360
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A claim that the tower looked too small)</font>

657
00:15:55,120 --> 00:15:56,780
<font size="64">Yes. The tower would've been closer.</font>

658
00:15:56,780 --> 00:15:57,950
<font size="64">You know that things...</font>

659
00:15:57,950 --> 00:15:59,720
<font size="64">appear smaller in photos, right?</font>

660
00:15:58,430 --> 00:16:04,400
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Jong Kook's reasoning: It can be closer than it looks in the photo.)</font>

661
00:15:59,720 --> 00:16:00,890
<font size="64">- Yes. - Right?</font>

662
00:16:01,120 --> 00:16:02,420
<font size="64">It could be closer than you think.</font>

663
00:16:02,420 --> 00:16:04,890
<font size="64">- I'll take a photo there myself. - Okay.</font>

664
00:16:04,960 --> 00:16:06,460
<font size="64">- Do you think... - I doubt it's Yongsan.</font>

665
00:16:05,370 --> 00:16:07,870
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Getting ahead of himself)</font>

666
00:16:06,460 --> 00:16:08,000
<font size="64">we'll find it in one go thanks to Se Chan?</font>

667
00:16:08,000 --> 00:16:09,100
<font size="64">- That would be crazy. - Right?</font>

668
00:16:09,100 --> 00:16:10,600
<font size="64">- It's possible. - Then it's not Yongsan.</font>

669
00:16:10,600 --> 00:16:12,100
<font size="64">- It's too close. - Are there red buildings there too?</font>

670
00:16:12,100 --> 00:16:13,100
<font size="64">There are lots of buildings there,</font>

671
00:16:12,680 --> 00:16:14,680
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Yes.)</font>

672
00:16:13,100 --> 00:16:15,100
<font size="64">and the area on the left is still under development.</font>

673
00:16:15,640 --> 00:16:17,270
<font size="64">Could it be Jonggak?</font>

674
00:16:17,270 --> 00:16:19,670
<font size="64">- Ji Hyo said something. - What did she say?</font>

675
00:16:19,670 --> 00:16:21,010
<font size="64">- What I said before. - What's that?</font>

676
00:16:21,010 --> 00:16:23,040
<font size="64">- If you think of red buildings... - Yes.</font>

677
00:16:23,280 --> 00:16:24,880
<font size="64">There are lots in Jonggak or Jongno.</font>

678
00:16:24,880 --> 00:16:26,650
<font size="64">- I agree. - In that area.</font>

679
00:16:26,650 --> 00:16:28,150
<font size="64">- Buildings like that... - Right?</font>

680
00:16:28,150 --> 00:16:29,780
<font size="64">- exist in Gangnam and elsewhere. - There are lots.</font>

681
00:16:29,780 --> 00:16:31,350
<font size="64">The way you say that...</font>

682
00:16:31,100 --> 00:16:34,000
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He notices him looking down on him with the way he speaks.)</font>

683
00:16:31,490 --> 00:16:33,350
<font size="64">- Kyobo Tower is red too. - Listen.</font>

684
00:16:33,350 --> 00:16:34,960
<font size="64">I get it. I could be wrong.</font>

685
00:16:34,960 --> 00:16:37,690
<font size="64">But the way you Antenna people say it is really hurtful.</font>

686
00:16:37,990 --> 00:16:39,490
<font size="64">- But it's a fact. - There are three of us today.</font>

687
00:16:39,400 --> 00:16:41,140
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Jae Seok)</font>

688
00:16:39,490 --> 00:16:40,860
<font size="64">I thought you were right, Jae Seok.</font>

689
00:16:40,860 --> 00:16:43,260
<font size="64">- I'm sure he is, Kyu Hyun. - You had a point.</font>

690
00:16:43,260 --> 00:16:45,730
<font size="64">- Kyu Hyun's backing up his friend. - You're bright-eyed today.</font>

691
00:16:45,730 --> 00:16:47,430
<font size="64">- It was logical. - He had a point.</font>

692
00:16:48,040 --> 00:16:50,770
<font size="64">- The building wasn't right ahead. - Was it a modern building?</font>

693
00:16:48,850 --> 00:16:51,320
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Jae Seok's reasoning:)</font>

694
00:16:51,210 --> 00:16:53,540
<font size="64">- It was to the side. - To the side...</font>

695
00:16:51,320 --> 00:16:53,780
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The red-brick building was on the right side.)</font>

696
00:16:53,540 --> 00:16:55,510
<font size="64">Did it feel like it was taken from an overpass?</font>

697
00:16:56,180 --> 00:16:57,540
<font size="64">- Railings. - Muakjae?</font>

698
00:16:57,540 --> 00:16:58,950
<font size="64">- There? - Hey, Haebangchon, maybe?</font>

699
00:16:59,210 --> 00:17:00,950
<font size="64">- It looked a bit... - Haebangchon...</font>

700
00:16:59,390 --> 00:17:01,530
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Not agreeing)</font>

701
00:17:00,950 --> 00:17:03,480
<font size="64">- An old, undeveloped... - It's not Haebangchon.</font>

702
00:17:03,690 --> 00:17:06,660
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Mr. Thimble's opinion gets ignored again.)</font>

703
00:17:03,920 --> 00:17:05,250
<font size="64">- It's not Haebangchon. - Couldn't it be a place like that?</font>

704
00:17:05,250 --> 00:17:07,050
<font size="64">- It's like... - I'm feeling Haebangchon.</font>

705
00:17:07,050 --> 00:17:08,590
<font size="64">Maybe Yongsan or Itaewon...</font>

706
00:17:08,590 --> 00:17:10,960
<font size="64">- Haebangchon. - Haebangchon.</font>

707
00:17:10,960 --> 00:17:12,930
<font size="64">- Haebangchon. - Haebangchon sounds right.</font>

708
00:17:12,930 --> 00:17:14,130
<font size="64">- Darn you! - What's wrong?</font>

709
00:17:14,530 --> 00:17:16,560
<font size="64">You said no when I mentioned Haebangchon.</font>

710
00:17:14,570 --> 00:17:17,670
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They blatantly tease Haha.)</font>

711
00:17:16,560 --> 00:17:17,730
<font size="64">But he mentioned it.</font>

712
00:17:17,730 --> 00:17:19,130
<font size="64">Haebangchon sounds right.</font>

713
00:17:19,130 --> 00:17:21,340
<font size="64">- Hey. That's red. - Why? What is it?</font>

714
00:17:21,450 --> 00:17:24,720
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Seoul Square)</font>

715
00:17:21,600 --> 00:17:23,440
<font size="64">- There's a red building? - Jae Seok needs to check.</font>

716
00:17:23,670 --> 00:17:25,110
<font size="64">He said it wasn't this kind of building.</font>

717
00:17:25,110 --> 00:17:27,140
<font size="64">It can't be the old Seoul Station.</font>

718
00:17:27,140 --> 00:17:28,980
<font size="64">It wasn't that kind of feel.</font>

719
00:17:27,220 --> 00:17:29,820
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Old Seoul Station)</font>

720
00:17:28,980 --> 00:17:29,980
<font size="64">Yes, that's it.</font>

721
00:17:29,980 --> 00:17:31,380
<font size="64">- The Daewoo building... - That kind of red.</font>

722
00:17:31,480 --> 00:17:32,650
<font size="64">Is it a cathedral?</font>

723
00:17:32,950 --> 00:17:34,110
<font size="64">- Hey. - Myeongdong Catholic Cathedral?</font>

724
00:17:34,680 --> 00:17:35,780
<font size="64">- He said no. - A cathedral?</font>

725
00:17:35,630 --> 00:17:37,060
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Cathedral)</font>

726
00:17:35,880 --> 00:17:37,250
<font size="64">- There's one there. - We can't tell.</font>

727
00:17:37,250 --> 00:17:38,850
<font size="64">- Are cathedrals red? - Guys.</font>

728
00:17:37,330 --> 00:17:39,560
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(This is a church.)</font>

729
00:17:38,850 --> 00:17:39,890
<font size="64">I won't say who...</font>

730
00:17:39,890 --> 00:17:42,390
<font size="64">I won't say who it is, but don't point everywhere...</font>

731
00:17:42,390 --> 00:17:44,320
<font size="64">- asking if that's it. - Right.</font>

732
00:17:44,320 --> 00:17:45,730
<font size="64">Keep quiet if you didn't see the photo.</font>

733
00:17:46,600 --> 00:17:49,870
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Dumbfounded)</font>

734
00:17:46,960 --> 00:17:48,260
<font size="64">What? If I didn't see it?</font>

735
00:17:48,260 --> 00:17:50,160
<font size="64">- No one else here saw the photo. - Hey.</font>

736
00:17:50,230 --> 00:17:52,300
<font size="64">- Hey, say the right stuff, then. - You...</font>

737
00:17:51,110 --> 00:17:55,380
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Chief Yu starts regulating the ones running wild.)</font>

738
00:17:52,300 --> 00:17:53,900
<font size="64">You point at any red building.</font>

739
00:17:53,900 --> 00:17:55,740
<font size="64">Say the right stuff, then.</font>

740
00:17:55,740 --> 00:17:57,070
<font size="64">- "Is this it? Is that it?" - Jae Seok.</font>

741
00:17:57,050 --> 00:17:59,080
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Getting angry)</font>

742
00:17:57,070 --> 00:17:59,270
<font size="64">What size was it? How big was the building?</font>

743
00:17:59,340 --> 00:18:00,440
<font size="64">Gosh...</font>

744
00:18:00,440 --> 00:18:01,710
<font size="64">Did you point at something too?</font>

745
00:18:01,980 --> 00:18:03,340
<font size="64">- Yes. - Me too.</font>

746
00:18:03,220 --> 00:18:06,060
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The 2 sniping targets)</font>

747
00:18:04,010 --> 00:18:05,480
<font size="64">I wasn't sure who he meant.</font>

748
00:18:05,480 --> 00:18:06,710
<font size="64">- Goodness. - I think it's you both.</font>

749
00:18:06,710 --> 00:18:08,020
<font size="64">- Both of us? - Yes.</font>

750
00:18:08,060 --> 00:18:10,330
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Thinking)</font>

751
00:18:11,050 --> 00:18:13,090
<font size="64">- The drama "Itaewon Class." - Yes.</font>

752
00:18:11,500 --> 00:18:13,560
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(There was a place where...)</font>

753
00:18:13,090 --> 00:18:15,190
<font size="64">I know where Park Se Ro Yi shot one of the scenes.</font>

754
00:18:13,560 --> 00:18:15,600
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Park Se Ro Yi was in "Itaewon Class.")</font>

755
00:18:15,190 --> 00:18:16,320
<font size="64">- Oh, really? - Yes.</font>

756
00:18:16,320 --> 00:18:17,930
<font size="64">N Seoul Tower is clearly visible from there.</font>

757
00:18:17,870 --> 00:18:20,600
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The place became famous thanks to the drama.)</font>

758
00:18:17,930 --> 00:18:20,030
<font size="64">Park Se Ro Yi in "Itaewon Class"...</font>

759
00:18:20,030 --> 00:18:21,130
<font size="64">I don't think it's "Itaewon Class."</font>

760
00:18:20,700 --> 00:18:23,540
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The Park Se Ro Yi Overpass became a famous photo spot.)</font>

761
00:18:21,130 --> 00:18:22,400
<font size="64">- It is. - Okay.</font>

762
00:18:22,560 --> 00:18:25,300
<font size="64">We're looking for a place where people take photos.</font>

763
00:18:24,540 --> 00:18:28,380
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Jae Seok's reasoning: It must be a famous photo spot.)</font>

764
00:18:25,570 --> 00:18:27,970
<font size="64">I think it's likely to be a popular place like that.</font>

765
00:18:27,970 --> 00:18:30,500
<font size="64">Lots of people pose on the overpass like Park Se Ro Yi.</font>

766
00:18:30,500 --> 00:18:32,710
<font size="64">- Do they? - On the pedestrian overpass.</font>

767
00:18:32,710 --> 00:18:34,210
<font size="64">- I see. - On the pedestrian overpass.</font>

768
00:18:34,210 --> 00:18:35,510
<font size="64">- Yes. - Facing the tower.</font>

769
00:18:35,510 --> 00:18:38,010
<font size="64">- Hey! - Do you think...</font>

770
00:18:38,050 --> 00:18:40,150
<font size="64">- The overpass? - It's the overpass! The railing!</font>

771
00:18:40,150 --> 00:18:41,550
<font size="64">- Let's go there. - The overpass railing.</font>

772
00:18:41,090 --> 00:18:45,930
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Did Jae Seok see the Park Se Ro Yi Overpass?)</font>

773
00:18:41,550 --> 00:18:42,880
<font size="64">- Let's go where Park Se Ro Yi was. - Hey.</font>

774
00:18:42,880 --> 00:18:44,420
<font size="64">There's an overpass with a clear view near HYBE.</font>

775
00:18:44,650 --> 00:18:45,950
<font size="64">- Wait. - It's not near HYBE.</font>

776
00:18:45,930 --> 00:18:47,060
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Candidate 2: Myeongdong Kyoja)</font>

777
00:18:45,950 --> 00:18:47,390
<font size="64">- HYBE is too far. - It's not near HYBE.</font>

778
00:18:47,060 --> 00:18:48,230
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(New candidate: Park Se Ro Yi Overpass)</font>

779
00:18:47,390 --> 00:18:48,560
<font size="64">- That's too far. - Let's go to Se Ro Yi's spot.</font>

780
00:18:48,230 --> 00:18:49,400
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The new candidate...)</font>

781
00:18:48,790 --> 00:18:52,030
<font size="64">I was at the Myeongdong Kyoja building a couple of days ago.</font>

782
00:18:49,400 --> 00:18:53,200
