3878
01:31:40,760 --> 01:31:42,120
<font size="64">I'll see you next year.</font>

3879
01:31:41,030 --> 01:31:43,140
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Simple)</font>

3880
01:31:43,700 --> 01:31:46,270
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A simple goodbye that befits a Running Man member)</font>

3881
01:31:44,090 --> 01:31:45,630
<font size="64">- I'll be back with another song. - He'll come back next year.</font>

3882
01:31:45,630 --> 01:31:48,230
<font size="64">- Good. - We'll begin the penalty.</font>

3883
01:31:48,330 --> 01:31:50,370
<font size="64">One, two, three.</font>

3884
01:31:51,140 --> 01:31:53,850
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A clean, direct shot)</font>

3885
01:31:55,240 --> 01:31:56,640
<font size="64">- Nice! - Good.</font>

3886
01:31:56,640 --> 01:31:57,810
<font size="64">Thank you for today.</font>

3887
01:31:57,810 --> 01:31:59,980
<font size="64">- Thank you. - Thank you.</font>

3888
01:31:59,890 --> 01:32:05,260
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(We thank Kyu Hyun for promising to come again.)</font>

3889
01:32:00,040 --> 01:32:01,040
<font size="64">Thanks, Cho Kyu.</font>

3890
01:32:01,040 --> 01:32:03,380
<font size="64">- Good work, Cho Kyu. - Thanks, Cho Kyu.</font>

3891
01:32:05,350 --> 01:32:06,820
<font size="64">- What is this? - What?</font>

3892
01:32:06,820 --> 01:32:08,420
<font size="64">- In the peaceful Running Village, - What is this?</font>

3893
01:32:07,030 --> 01:32:09,560
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(It gets the members' blood boiling right from the commute.)</font>

3894
01:32:08,520 --> 01:32:10,850
<font size="64">someone dropped R coins.</font>

3895
01:32:09,630 --> 01:32:12,100
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The beginning of a brutal fairytale of the quick-riches fever)</font>

3896
01:32:10,850 --> 01:32:12,220
<font size="64">Is this "Hansel and Gretel" or what?</font>

3897
01:32:12,220 --> 01:32:13,260
<font size="64">- Right at the moment, - Aren't these...</font>

3898
01:32:13,260 --> 01:32:14,290
<font size="64">dropped a bit too obviously?</font>

3899
01:32:14,290 --> 01:32:16,660
<font size="64">the Tiger Moths have appeared, reeking of greed.</font>

3900
01:32:14,970 --> 01:32:17,400
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The new Tiger Moth joins in.)</font>

3901
01:32:16,660 --> 01:32:18,690
<font size="64">I look so uncool right from my entrance.</font>

3902
01:32:19,160 --> 01:32:20,460
<font size="64">You three look so much alike.</font>

3903
01:32:20,510 --> 01:32:22,410
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Familiar mouth structures)</font>

3904
01:32:20,600 --> 01:32:22,530
<font size="64">Lee Kwang Soo, Nam Chang Hee,</font>

3905
01:32:22,530 --> 01:32:24,430
<font size="64">and Peppertones.</font>

3906
01:32:22,540 --> 01:32:24,580
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Antenna-style Tiger Moth, Kang Ki Young)</font>

3907
01:32:24,730 --> 01:32:26,200
<font size="64">- Who is she? - Who are you?</font>

3908
01:32:24,740 --> 01:32:27,750
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Running Man's Lu Bu stirs up the original Tiger Moths.)</font>

3909
01:32:26,200 --> 01:32:27,840
<font size="64">- Hello, Seok Jin. - Who are you?</font>

3910
01:32:27,850 --> 01:32:29,120
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Mixed feelings)</font>

3911
01:32:27,870 --> 01:32:29,110
<font size="64">- She's my senior from "SNL." - I can't deny it.</font>

3912
01:32:29,110 --> 01:32:30,110
<font size="64">Hyun Young, was there strict discipline at "SNL"?</font>

3913
01:32:30,110 --> 01:32:31,470
<font size="64">I can't say there was none.</font>

3914
01:32:30,350 --> 01:32:31,620
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Quite strict)</font>

3915
01:32:31,720 --> 01:32:34,050
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The Gen Z comes to kick out the original members.)</font>

3916
01:32:33,210 --> 01:32:34,310
<font size="64">I'm so embarrassed.</font>

3917
01:32:34,220 --> 01:32:35,590
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Gen Z Tiger Moth, Joo Hyun Young)</font>

3918
01:32:34,310 --> 01:32:35,610
<font size="64">This looks like a scene from a drama.</font>

3919
01:32:36,010 --> 01:32:39,050
<font size="64">- What is this? - I can't bring myself to smile.</font>

3920
01:32:36,220 --> 01:32:39,160
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The prologue to a final bet with their fates on the line)</font>

3921
01:32:39,050 --> 01:32:40,450
<font size="64">I'm right in the middle.</font>

3922
01:32:40,550 --> 01:32:41,920
<font size="64">We can't even find out who is in 1st place.</font>

3923
01:32:40,690 --> 01:32:42,230
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A psychological battle between the one trying to figure it out...)</font>

3924
01:32:41,920 --> 01:32:44,050
<font size="64">We just need one more person here.</font>

3925
01:32:42,230 --> 01:32:43,760
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(and the one trying to deceive)</font>

3926
01:32:43,760 --> 01:32:46,900
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(You have to read your opponent's moves to win.)</font>

3927
01:32:44,050 --> 01:32:45,720
<font size="64">- First place has to run. - I can't go.</font>

3928
01:32:45,720 --> 01:32:46,820
<font size="64">This is giving me chills.</font>

3929
01:32:46,820 --> 01:32:49,730
<font size="64">- That's just incredible. - Stay there.</font>

3930
01:32:47,430 --> 01:32:49,200
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(If your brain doesn't work, use your body.)</font>

3931
01:32:49,640 --> 01:32:52,770
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The showdown of the Tiger Moths is heating up.)</font>

3932
01:32:49,730 --> 01:32:51,690
<font size="64">Don't do that!</font>

3933
01:32:52,160 --> 01:32:53,800
<font size="64">Stop it!</font>

3934
01:32:52,840 --> 01:32:56,280
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Who is the winner of the life-or-death round?)</font>

3935
01:32:53,800 --> 01:32:56,400
<font size="64">- I can't go! - No!</font>

3936
01:32:56,710 --> 01:32:58,680
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Young Young's Scramble)</font>

3937
01:32:58,740 --> 01:33:06,720
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Running Man)</font>
